  "notes": "{運航|うんこう} specifically refers to the operation of ships and aircraft, not land vehicles.\n\nWORD COMPOSITION:\n- {運|うん}: transport, carry\n- {航|こう}: navigate, sail, fly\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {運航|うんこう}する: to operate (transport service)\n- {運航|うんこう}{中止|ちゅうし}: service suspension\n- {運航|うんこう}{再開|さいかい}: resumption of service\n- {運航|うんこう}スケジュール: operation schedule\n- {運航|うんこう}{状況|じょうきょう}: operation status\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {運行|うんこう}: operation (for trains, buses - land transport)\n- Both are read うんこう but use different kanji",
